. The form will disappear and all the spots that are )TjT* (included in the User Set will be highlighted in the Standard.)Tj/F7 14 Tf-18 -38.5 TD [ (9.2. )-1 (Higher Level Matchsets)] TJ/F6 10 Tf18 -21.5 TD (PDQUEST allows you to create matchsets from matchsets, so you can build a )Tj0 -12 TD (database by comparing and summarizing the results of a series of )TjT* (experiments.)Tj0 -20 TD (\322Higher level\323 matchsets are matchsets created from the Standard images of )Tj0 -12 TD (other \(\322lower level\323\) matchsets. A lower level matchset might be a matchset )TjT* (created from your original gels \(a \322level-1\323 matchset\), or it could be another )TjT* (higher level matchset \(that is nevertheless \322lower\323 than the one you are )TjETendstreamendobj1194 0 obj2769endobj1192 0 obj<</Type /Page/Parent 1158 0 R/Resources <</Font <</F4 16 0 R /F6 20 0 R /F7 25 0 R >>/ProcSet 2 0 R>>/Contents 1193 0 R>>endobj1197 0 obj<</Length 1198 0 R>>stream
